cells:
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "# percent change\r

      Percenta change is a way of expressing the difference between two values
      as a percentage of the the orgianal value .        \r

      It is used to how how much a value has increase or decreased over a given
      period of time , or to compare the two differenct values"
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: $ \text{percent change} = \frac{\text{new value} - \text{old
      value}}{\text{old value}} * 100 $
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
    value: "percentage change sa aap ek quantity ko track karta ho over
      time        \r

      pata karta ho vo value kitna sa bada kitna sa gata"
    metadata: {}
  - kind: 1
    languageId: markdown
